# DL / Vision Experiment Orchestration

1. Build the experiment matrix first.
2. Use stable, machine-parsable run naming.
3. Map jobs to GPUs and dependencies explicitly.
4. Define which artifacts are official outputs.
5. Define restart/resume rules before launching batches.
